      "detail": "The request states TRAIN = 100. The governed EXP-002 contract prepared under DEC-0049 uses the 560-row split. Adopting 100 rows would remove 460 training examples (an 82% reduction in training data) and is a MATERIAL dataset change that the standing rule requires to be evidenced and governed before training. This projection is the evidence; the governance decision is separate and has NOT been taken.",
