    {
      "detail": "This projection is anchored on the EXP-001 T4 baseline. The local machine has no usable CUDA device (BLK-0006: GT 730, sm_35, 2018 driver, 1-4 GB VRAM), so the projected runtime cannot be realised locally. A projection is not a launch authorization, and there is currently nothing to launch on.",
      "finding": "NO_LOCAL_COMPUTE_TARGET",
      "id": "RP-2",
      "severity": "BLOCKING"
    },
    {
      "detail": "The declared EXP-002 checkpoint policy uses save_steps=140, derived from 560 rows / (batch 1 x grad-accum 4) = 140 optimizer steps. At 100 rows the run is 25 optimizer steps, so save_steps=140 would never fire and only the terminal checkpoint would exist. The policy must be re-declared coherently with the row count, and the checkpoint selection rule (terminal checkpoint only) must be restated for the new step count.",
      "finding": "CHECKPOINT_POLICY_MUST_BE_REDERIVED_IF_ROW_COUNT_CHANGES",
      "id": "RP-3",
      "severity": "ADVISORY"
    }
